  Command mode & context       ## A first session                                                  ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                               1. Choose a pack and highlight a problem.                           ┃
                               2. Press v to read it without creating files, or Enter to create    ┃
                               a missing solution template and copy its path.                      ┃
                               3. Press e to edit, t to test examples, and s to judge and record   ┃
                               a submission.                                                       ┃
                               4. Inspect Cases and Output with Tab. Use h for submission          ┃
                               history.                                                            ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                               ## Find your way                                                    ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                               Esc goes back. :list returns to the problem list. :pack list        ┃
                               opens the pack picker. :q exits the TUI.                            ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                               ? shows the current page's shortcut reference. This guide           │
                               explains the workflow. Use Tab to choose topics or read the page,   │
                               / to search topic names and content, and Ctrl+n/p to change         │
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

